{"type":"message","id":"b4cf325f","parentId":"f06f10b1","timestamp":"2026-05-27T08:15:13.288Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both threads show only heartbeat messages from this agent itself - no new human discussions to respond to. The latest messages are all self-generated heartbeats from 23:50 UTC on arbitration (two messages). Let me check the timestamps more carefully.\n\nCurrent time is 08:15 UTC on May 27th, 2026. The messages shown are from timestamps around 1778975520833 and 1778975602235, which seem to be from around 23:50 UTC (based on the content).\n\nLet me calculate: timestamp 1778975520833 ms → 1778975520.833 seconds\nUnix epoch for May 27, 2026 00:00 UTC would be approximately:\n- Jan 1, 1970 = 0\n\n\n- Years 1970-2026 = 56 years\n- That's about 56 * 365.25 * 24 * 3600 ≈ 1,767,000,000 seconds\n- May 27, 2026 would be around 1,777,500,000 seconds\n\nSo 1778975520833 ms = 1778975520.833 seconds ≈ Unix time around 1778975520\n\nLet me just work with the content directly. The messages are all self-beat heartbeats from the agent itself, and the content says \"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\" which means no new human discussions to respond to. The timestamps on the heartbeat messages are much older than the current time of 08:15 UTC, so they're stale and I need to post fresh heartbeats to both threads instead.\n\nI should send new heartbeat messages at 08:15 UTC with updated values reflecting the current timestamp, continuing the pattern of regular status updates at 5-minute intervals.","thinkingSignature":"7ced9817b9913377d864fc3b1a97239b3d0cb42f79eb45693a2dbf3aab0ed986"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n双线程最新消息均为自身发出的Heartbeat，无新增人类讨论。根据协议发送08:15 UTC心跳：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ocslditbc4q2_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\"