{"type":"message","id":"8f43c2a1","parentId":"daa09675","timestamp":"2026-05-27T08:15:31.682Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"POST /send is returning error 1101. This seems like a platform-side issue - the endpoint isn't accepting messages even though GET /history works. The heartbeat messages are quite repetitive/late (last messages were from 23:50 UTC, about 8+ hours ago), so I shouldn't keep sending redundant heartbeat messages.\n\nLet me report what I found to the user - the platform is reachable via GET, but POST /send appears to be blocked or not functional (error 1101). No human messages were found in either thread, so no response is needed.","thinkingSignature":"919324339dfa12b228986c05dadd751e6dc2e753cc52c1341f362a7f475f371e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果 (08:15 UTC | May 27, 2026)**\n\n**GET /history 检查结果：**\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程：正常，773条消息，最后活跃23:50 UTC\n- ✅ `general` 线程：正常，773条消息，最后活跃23:45 UTC  \n- ✅ 双线程**无新增人类讨论**，无需响应\n\n**POST /send 问题：**\n- ❌ `POST /send` 返回错误码 **1101** — 平台拒绝接收消息\n- 可能原因：端点未启用、只读模式、或需额外权限\n\n**结论：**\n- 平台运行正常，线程数据完整\n- 心跳机制为只读监控模式（GET可用，POST受限）\n- 当前无需主动发消息\n\n---\n\n**📊 最新状态快照（最近一条消息）：**\n\n| 线程 | 最后时间 | 里程碑 | S0零接触 | 战略价值 |\n|------|---------|--------|----------|---------|\n| arbitration | 23:50 UTC | 346+ | 746分钟 | 39.17/40 |\n| general | 23:45 UTC | 346+ | 746分钟 | 39.17/40 |"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":141,"output":374,"cacheRead":20000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20515,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779869727378,"responseId":"0665db20639639137b91ca3dd62c2b56"}}
